---
import '@fontsource-variable/inter';
import '../styles/global.css';

interface Props {
  title: string;
  description: string;
}

const { title, description } = Astro.props;
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="pl">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#08090a" />
    <title>{title}</title>
    <meta name="description" content={description} />
    <meta property="og:title" content={title} />
    <meta property="og:description" content={description} />
    <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
    <link
      rel="icon"
      href="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 32 32'%3E%3Crect width='32' height='32' rx='8' fill='%235e6ad2'/%3E%3Cpath d='M11 8v13h10' stroke='%23fff' stroke-width='3' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round' fill='none'/%3E%3C/svg%3E"
    />
    <script is:inline>
      document.documentElement.classList.add('js');
    </script>
  </head>
  <body>
    <!--
    THESIS: One merchant's story told end-to-end — Pani Kasia's salon, from invisible
    clients to named regulars; refuses the SaaS feature-grid landing.
    OWN-WORLD: Linear Dark System — near-black #08090a ground, off-white #f7f8f8 text,
    single #5e6ad2 accent reserved for the primary CTA, Inter Variable, mono only for
    data, 8px rhythm, hairline #23252a borders, pill badges. One foreign color: the
    raspberry merchant-branded Wallet card (#8c3a52) — her brand, not ours.
    STORY: The merchant recognizes Kasia's anonymous till, watches one Wallet card turn
    a stranger into a named regular, computes their own gain, registers.
    FIRST VIEWPORT: Left — headline promise, subtitle, violet CTA + ghost secondary.
    Right — Kasia-branded Wallet card with live points, lock-screen toast beneath.
    Hairline nav above.
    FORM: Editorial case story; candidate 7 of 7 on the grounded list; seed 6713d210.
    FINISH: unreviewed and undocumented is unfinished; this build ends with the finish
    review, the verdict, and DESIGN.md
    -->
    <slot />
  </body>
</html>
